        "text_Ub47yL": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "margin_top_mobile": "mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_mobile": "mb-md",
            "padding_top_mobile": "pt-lg",
            "padding_bottom_mobile": "pb-md",
            "margin_top_desktop": "desktop:mt-lg",
            "margin_bottom_desktop": "desktop:mb-lg",
            "padding_top_desktop": "desktop:pt-0",
            "padding_bottom_desktop": "desktop:pb-0",
            "max_width_desktop": "135ch",
            "richtext": "<h4><strong>4. Protect the Most Sensitive at Home<\/strong> <\/h4><p><\/p><p>Children, babies, and pets are often more vulnerable to pollutants. A wellness-first home supports them by: <\/p><ul><li>Minimizing allergens, odors, and pet dander. <\/li><li>Creating gentle air environments that protect little lungs and developing bodies. <\/li><li>Choosing cleaning and household products free of harsh chemicals. <\/li><\/ul><p> Creating a safe environment for them naturally makes the home healthier for everyone. <\/p><p> <\/p><h4><strong>5. Integrate Nature and Simplicity<\/strong> <\/h4><p><\/p><p>Wellness at home thrives when nature and design meet. <\/p><ul><li>Incorporate indoor plants that purify and freshen air while bringing life into your spaces. <\/li><li>Let in natural light to balance circadian rhythms and lift mood. <\/li><li>Simplify your home — wellness is supported by environments that are breathable, open, and uncluttered. <\/li><\/ul><p> <\/p><h4><strong>The Wellness-First Home of the Future<\/strong> <\/h4><p><\/p><p>Creating a non-toxic, wellness-focused home isn’t about one product or one room. It’s about an integrated lifestyle approach — where every choice, from the air you breathe to the textures you touch, supports your long-term health. <\/p><p> <\/p><p>With modern solutions that make total air wellness effortless, your home can evolve into a place that truly sustains and restores you — a sanctuary designed for better living, today and for years to come. <\/p>",
            "richtext_alignment": "text-left",
            "richtext_style": "p2"
          }
        }
      },
